{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026T6LOWWjEek1793200032.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>於馬鞍山上演的中國手球超級聯賽，港隊以1分險勝山東紫光優健。</p><p></p><p>白衫港隊的隊長謝永輝全場6射5中。在中路突破的連潤滔就取得全隊最高9分。港隊上場派不少副選「試陣」，今場主力回歸。</p><p></p><p>雖然全隊失誤有10次，比對手多1次，但門將梁嵐熹表現出色，包括擋走對手最後一攻，令港隊險勝31-30，下場對U20聯隊。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:13.968560+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.859568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:39.707830+00:00","content_hash":"7dc7ef64f9eea0bf3af3f28096b4b9385222bc7d4c065ef3c865a60e7776ada4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:13.968560+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}